Read customer-support/AGENTS.md and customer-support/README.md before editing.
This is the user-authorized local Qwen/Hermes support module, separate from the
Grok Assembly/ Akay desk. Preserve that desk and existing invitation tables.

Keep runtime code, persona, configuration, installation, tests, and operations
instructions in the repository. Local ~/.hermes changes alone are not a delivery.
Never commit secrets, WhatsApp pairing sessions, model weights, real contacts,
local outbox databases, or private conversation logs. Keep Supabase service keys
server-only and use the existing FMI project for authorized live setup.

New persona, orchestration, and RAG work should follow the module's extension
boundaries. Do not claim planned components are implemented. Run the support
tests and record live verification separately from offline mocked tests.
